Write a query to display the least N salaries.
(Use In-Line Views)
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------
-- Example: Display the least 3 salaries

sql> SELECT *
     FROM
     (
         SELECT EMPNO, ENAME, SAL
         FROM EMP
         ORDER BY SAL
     )
     WHERE ROWNUM <= 3;

Output:
-------

EMPNO   ENAME    SAL
------  -------  ----
7369    SMITH     800
7900    JAMES     950
7876    ADAMS    1100
